<title>CHINA: Shanghai Vacuum no 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Vacuum no 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Shanghai Vacuum and Electron Device Co Ltd have approved a proposal by the firm to offer no returns to investors based on 1996 results, a company statement said on Friday.</p>
<p>The company earlier posted a net loss of 49.729 million yuan for 1996 compared with a profit of 121.08 million yuan for 1995 based on international accounting standards.</p>
</text>
